    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=YVv8ZsQabqXF79Cy]], one creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within 30 feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=YVv8ZsQabqXF79Cy]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Paralyzed apply=false] condition until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}’s next turn unless the target has Immunity to Cold damage. <em>Success:</em> The target is immune to the Chilling Gaze of all yetis (but not abominable yetis) for 1 hour.</p>",
